menu "Modulus Zig C6"

config MODULUS_ZIG_C6_RUNTIME
    bool "Link Modulus Zig C6 runtime (modulus_zig_c6)"
    default n
    help
        Opt-in: app_main starts Zig via modulus_c6_runtime_start().
        Product image stays C (espnow_handler + hosted). Enable only for experiments.

config MODULUS_C6_BLE
    bool "NimBLE controller on C6 (MODULUS_TAB5 GAP name)"
    default y
    help
        Local NimBLE host after esp_hosted init. esp_hosted 2.11 RPC is Wi-Fi-only;
        P4 BLE HCI/RPC is a later milestone. Disable to save flash/RAM.

config MODULUS_C6_ESPNOW
    bool "ESP-NOW peer links on C6 (alongside esp_hosted Wi-Fi)"
    default n
    help
        Autonomous esp_now on C6 after esp_wifi_start. Default off: SDIO
        espnow_handler owns callbacks. Enable only for experiments.

config MODULUS_C6_ESPNOW_SEND_TEST
    bool "Send ESP-NOW test broadcast (MODULUS) on init"
    default y
    depends on MODULUS_C6_ESPNOW

config MODULUS_C6_THREAD
    bool "OpenThread 802.15.4 on C6 (detached milestone)"
    default n
    depends on !MODULUS_C6_ZIGBEE_EXCLUSIVE
    select OPENTHREAD_ENABLED
    help
        Off by default: ESP-NOW-first Modulus image keeps C6 free of 802.15.4.
        Enable only for a dedicated Thread build (coex with Wi-Fi/BLE).
        Mutually exclusive with CONFIG_MODULUS_C6_ZIGBEE_EXCLUSIVE (one 802.15.4 radio).

config MODULUS_C6_ZIGBEE
    bool "Zigbee 802.15.4 policy on C6 (defer or exclusive stack)"
    default n
    help
        Default product: Zigbee on NanoH2, not C6.
        Enable CONFIG_MODULUS_C6_ZIGBEE_EXCLUSIVE + esp-zigbee-lib for ZBOSS init.

config MODULUS_C6_ZIGBEE_EXCLUSIVE
    bool "Zigbee exclusive (disables Thread; links esp-zigbee-lib)"
    default n
    depends on MODULUS_C6_ZIGBEE
    help
        One 802.15.4 radio cannot run OpenThread and ZBOSS together.
        Build with sdkconfig.defaults.zigbee and idf_component.zigbee.yml.
        Milestone: esp_zb_init log, factory-new, no network steering.

endmenu
